# clamber-scenario v1
id: entrance-throw
summary: Enter the level through its entrance holding Left from before the throw, steer left once steering starts, land, then walk right and jump.
requires: the first level begun from the level map, with its entrance at the start point (behavior/level-start.md); flat floor 185 px below the start point, from 100 px to 360 px right of it, with nothing above it in that span up to the start point's height; no walls or other ground along the throw's path; no entities other than the entrance within 120 px of the player at any time
start: the level's first frame (behavior/level-start.md), one character, nothing held before frame 0
frames: 200

[inputs]
30-109   L
120-199  R
160-169  J

[metrics]
final_x          tol 1
final_y          tol 0.5
curve x,y,vx from land for 40 tol 0.25
